# machine translated (Swahili), not yet reviewed by a person.

# Title of the Help topic "AI programs".
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-title = Programu za AI

# Words people might search for the Help topic "AI programs" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-keywords = ai claude codex cursor gemini aider coding agent fence private files share folder ssh keys sudo uzio faragha faili shiriki folda funguo

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p1 = Hii inazuia programu za AI zisifikie faili zako binafsi katika matumizi ya kila siku, kwa mfano ikiwa moja imedanganywa ikusanye taarifa za benki yako na kuzituma nje. Ni kinga yenye mipaka, si dhamana: programu iliyodhamiria, hitilafu katika programu za kompyuta, au wewe kuidhinisha ombi au kushiriki folda bado vinaweza kuruhusu kitu kipite.

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p2 = Programu iliyo ndani ya uzio huona folda tupu ya nyumbani. Hati zako, funguo za ssh, keyring na kuingia kwa kivinjari havipo vya kusomwa. Huona tu folda unazoshiriki, mahali pale pale kama zako. Mfumo wote mwingine unabaki kuonekana, kwa hiyo inaweza kusoma kumbukumbu na kuendesha amri. Kila inachoanzisha, pamoja na programu inazoweka, kinabaki ndani ya uzio.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-1 = Ili kushiriki folda, ibofye kulia kwenye Folders kisha uchague Shiriki na programu za AI, au tumia Shiriki folda kwenye ukurasa wa Programu za AI.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-2 = Folda zilizofichwa, na folda zinazohifadhi funguo, manenosiri au barua pepe, haziwezi kushirikiwa kamwe.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-3 = Ili kufikia kompyuta nyingine kwa ssh, iongeze kwenye ukurasa. Trindle hutumia ufunguo tofauti, kwa kompyuta ulizoorodhesha tu.

# Help topic "AI programs": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-step3-4 = Amri inayohitaji msimamizi hufungua dirisha nje ya uzio na kukusubiri.

# Help topic "AI programs": paragraph 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-ai-programs-p4 = Ni majina yaliyo kwenye ukurasa tu yanayoanza ndani ya uzio. Programu iliyoanzishwa kwa njia nyingine haiko ndani ya uzio. Ukizima uzio kwenye ukurasa, programu za AI zinaweza kuona kila kitu unachoweza kuona wewe.

# Title of the Help topic "Welcome to Trindle".
settings-help-topics-welcome-title = Karibu kwenye Trindle

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Welcome to Trindle" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-welcome-keywords = start begin new first introduction what is how edge open windows anza mwanzo mpya utangulizi karibu pembeni fungua madirisha

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p1 = Trindle inaiweka skrini yako wazi. Hakuna upau wala menyu pembezoni: madirisha yako tu na mandhari yako. Kila kitu kingine kiko kwenye duara moja, pete, inayoonekana unapoiita na kutoweka ukimaliza.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (ring-first.png).
settings-help-topics-welcome-pic2 = Pete, ikiwa na saa na tarehe katikati

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p3 = Kila kitu kinaweza kufanywa kwa kipanya au kidole. Hivi vinafungua pete, ambapo madirisha yako yalipo:

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-1 = Peleka kielekezi pembeni ya skrini kisha ubofye: pete inafunguka.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-2 = Kitufe cha Super pia kinaifungua.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-welcome-step4-3 = Madirisha yako yaliyofunguliwa yako kwenye pete: bofya moja ili kuliweka mbele.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-welcome-p5 = Karibu, ziara fupi inayofunguka unapoingia mara ya kwanza, inaonyesha yote haya kwa picha zinazosogea. Iko kwenye Programu zote kama Karibu wakati wowote ukitaka kuiona tena.

# Help topic "Welcome to Trindle": paragraph 6.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-welcome-p6 = Kitufe kinachoweza kupoteza kitu, kama pipa, huuliza mara mbili. Kubofya mara ya kwanza kunakijaza kwa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha alama ya tiki; bofya tena ili kuendelea. Kikiachwa, baada ya sekunde tatu kinarudi kama kilivyokuwa.

# Title of the Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps".
settings-help-topics-ring-title = Kufungua pete na kupata programu

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-ring-keywords = launcher tray icons brightness tools apps applications start menu open program edge click favourites favorites all apps categories office games type search find filter programu zote pendwa tafuta andika michezo ofisi mwangaza

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-ring-p1 = Peleka kielekezi kwenye ukingo kabisa wa skrini, ukingo wowote, kisha ubofye: pete inaonekana. Inafanya kazi hata dirisha likijaza skrini, lakini kamwe juu ya mchezo au video ya skrini nzima, ambapo kila kubofya ni la dirisha. Kusogeza kielekezi pale tu hakuifungui kamwe, kwa hiyo haitokei kwa bahati mbaya, na kubofya mahali pengine kwenye eneo-kazi hakufungui chochote. Kitufe cha Super pia kinaifungua, hata juu ya dirisha la skrini nzima. Kubofya mara mbili kwenye eneo-kazi tupu pia kunaifungua.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-ring-p2 = Katikati kuna saa na tarehe, na safu ya aikoni ndogo: sauti, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi na betri, kikombe kinachoweka skrini macho, kibodi ya skrini ikiwa imewashwa kwenye Mipangilio, Kibodi na kipanya, na, kwenye kompyuta yenye taa ya nyuma, mwangaza wa skrini (sogeza juu yake kuubadilisha, ibofye kupata kitelezi). Chini ya hizo kuna Programu zote, kitufe cha masasisho yakiwepo, na Nishati, yenye Funga skrini, Kihifadhi skrini, Simamisha, Hibernate kompyuta inapoweza, Toka, Washa upya na Zima.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-ring-p3 = Bofya aikoni ya sauti, Bluetooth, Wi-Fi au betri katikati na paneli ya duara inafunguka juu ya programu pendwa: badilisha sauti au kipaza sauti, unganisha vipokea sauti vya Bluetooth, jiunge na mtandao wa Wi-Fi, au uone betri itadumu kwa muda gani na imechakaa kiasi gani. Gia kwenye paneli inafungua ukurasa kamili wa Mipangilio; msalaba unaifunga.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-ring-p4 = Kuzunguka katikati kuna programu zako pendwa, zikiwemo Mipangilio, Programu na Folders daima, na duara nne za zana zilizochorwa kama programu: Picha ya skrini (kamera), Ubao wa kunakili, Arifa na Kikuza. Bofya programu ili kuifungua, au kuleta dirisha lake mbele. Programu zilizofunguliwa zinaonekana kwenye pete ya madirisha wazi kuzunguka pendwa, si miongoni mwa pendwa.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-ring-p5 = Aikoni za programu nyingine zinazoendeshwa, kama programu ya mazungumzo au zana ya hifadhi rudufu, ziko kwenye safu chini ya katikati. Bofya moja ili kufungua programu yake; ibofye kulia kupata menyu yake. Aikoni ya programu jalizi pia iko hapo: ibofye kuianzisha, au ibofye kulia kupata inachotoa, kama Unganisha na Tenganisha kwa Flow, na mipangilio yake.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": caption and spoken name of picture 6 (ring-all.png).
settings-help-topics-ring-pic6 = Programu zote: kila programu kuzunguka nje, vipande kwa aina

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-1 = Bofya Programu zote katikati. Kila programu ambayo si pendwa inaonekana kuzunguka nje, vipande vipande: Mtandao, Ofisi, Picha, Sauti na video, Michezo na kadhalika. Aina isiyo na programu zilizobaki haina kipande.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-2 = Bofya programu kwenye kipande chochote ili kuifungua.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-3 = Unatafuta programu moja? Andika tu herufi chache za jina lake: ni programu zinazolingana tu zinabaki, bora kwanza, na Enter inafungua ya kwanza. Escape inafuta ulichoandika.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 7.
settings-help-topics-ring-step7-4 = Bofya Programu zote tena ili kuondoa vipande.

# Help topic "Opening the ring and finding apps": tip 8, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-ring-tip8 = Bonyeza Escape, au bofya nje ya duara, ili kufunga pete.

