# Help topic "Keeping the screen awake": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-awake-p1 = Unatazama kitu, au unasoma bila kugusa kipanya? Bofya kikombe katikati ya pete. Kinawaka, na hadi ukibofye tena au utoke, skrini haififii, haifungi, haizimiki wala kulala.

# Help topic "Keeping the screen awake": tip 2, shown in a box of its own.
