settings-help-topics-favourites-keywords = favourite favourites favorite favorites keep add remove right-click drag move order pendwa weka ongeza ondoa buruta hamisha mpangilio

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p1 = Bofya kulia programu yoyote, kwenye pete au kati ya Programu zote, kisha uchague Ongeza kwa pendwa. Baada ya hapo inakaa daima kuzunguka katikati ya pete. Bofya kulia programu pendwa kisha uchague Ondoa kutoka pendwa ili kuiondoa. Katikati inabeba kumi na mbili.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p2 = Unaanza na Mipangilio, Programu, Folders, Vifaa vya hifadhi na Shughuli. Yoyote inaweza kuondolewa, na kurudishwa kutoka Programu zote.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-favourites-p3 = Ili kupanga programu pendwa kwa mpangilio tofauti, buruta moja kwa kipanya kisha uiachie kwenye nafasi ya nyingine; inachukua nafasi hiyo na zilizobaki zinasogea.

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": caption and spoken name of picture 4 (ring-menu.png).
settings-help-topics-favourites-pic4 = Bofya kulia programu kupata chaguo zaidi

# Help topic "Keeping your favourite apps in the ring": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-favourites-p5 = Menyu hiyo hiyo inaweza kufungua dirisha jingine la programu, kufunga madirisha yake, na, kwa programu zilizowekwa kutoka Programu, kuiondoa kabisa.

# Title of the Help topic "Switching between windows".
settings-help-topics-switcher-title = Kubadilisha kati ya madirisha

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Switching between windows" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-switcher-keywords = windows switch switcher alt tab open ring desktop show minimise clipboard copy paste history keyboard on screen madirisha badilisha eneo-kazi onyesha punguza ubao wa kunakili nakili bandika historia kibodi ya skrini

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p1 = Fungua pete na madirisha yako yaliyofunguliwa yako kwenye pete kuzunguka programu pendwa, sehemu moja kwa kila dirisha, ikiwa na aikoni ya programu yake na jina lake. Elekeza moja na katikati inaonyesha picha ya dirisha hilo; libofye kuliweka mbele, au libofye kulia kupata punguza, kuza na funga. Alt na Tab pia huleta kila dirisha lililofunguliwa mbele kwa zamu.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p2 = Super na D huweka kila dirisha kando ili kuonyesha eneo-kazi, na kuvirudisha. Bila kitu kilichofunguliwa, skrini ni safi.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-switcher-p3 = Ubao wa kunakili ni mojawapo ya duara nne za zana kati ya programu pendwa kwenye pete, na unafunguka kama paneli ya duara, kama ile ya sauti au Wi-Fi. Unaonyesha ulichonakili hivi karibuni, kipya kwanza: andika kwenye kichujio kupata kimoja, bofya kimoja kukinakili tena, na bandika vile unavyotaka vihifadhiwe daima. Msalaba mdogo kando ya mstari husahau huo tu, rahisi kwa nenosiri lililonakiliwa kwa makosa, na pipa chini husahau kila kitu isipokuwa vilivyobandikwa, na huuliza mara mbili. Kuchagua mstari kunauweka tu tena kwenye ubao wa kunakili: unabandika wewe mwenyewe, pale unapotaka uende, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachotua kwenye kisanduku ambacho hukuchagua. Mipangilio, Pete, Ubao wa kunakili inachagua lini kilichobaki kisahauliwe: kila kuwasha upya, baada ya siku, wiki au wiki mbili, au kamwe.

# Help topic "Switching between windows": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-switcher-p4 = Kibodi ya skrini ina aikoni yake ndogo katikati ya pete, ikishawashwa kwenye Mipangilio, Kibodi na kipanya, chini ya Kitufe cha kibodi kwenye pete. Inafungua kibodi chini ya skrini, na aikoni ile ile inaifunga tena.

# Title of the Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you".
settings-help-topics-notifications-title = Arifa: kile programu zinachokuambia

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-notifications-keywords = notification notifications alert message banner popup toast bell quiet silence do not disturb missed mail battery corner arifa ujumbe kengele kimya usisumbue barua pepe betri kona

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p1 = Programu ikiwa na kitu cha kukuambia, kama barua pepe kufika au betri kuisha, inaonekana kama duara dogo kwenye kona ya skrini, inabaki sekunde chache, kisha inaondoka. Hadi tatu zinaonekana kwa wakati mmoja, moja juu ya nyingine. Inakaa kwenye kona, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachotua juu ya unachosoma.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p2 = Duara la Arifa kwenye pete linafungua kila kilichosemwa, cha zamani zaidi juu na kipya zaidi chini, na saa kando ya kila kimoja. Ikiwa umekuwa mbali na kompyuta zinaweza kuwa nyingi sana, kwa hiyo orodha inafunguka chini, ambapo kipya kilipo, na unasogeza juu kupata za zamani.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-notifications-p3 = Kando ya kila mstari kuna vitufe viwili vidogo. Pini inaweka hiyo daima: inakusanywa juu ya zingine na kusahau kila kitu hakuiguzi. Pipa dogo husahau hiyo tu. Chini kuna kitufe cha kengele, kilichoelezwa hapa chini, na pipa linalosahau kila kitu isipokuwa zilizobandikwa na huuliza mara mbili.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p4 = Kila moja inakaa kwa muda gani ni juu yako kuchagua, kwenye Mipangilio, Pete, Arifa: sekunde tatu kwa mtazamo, kumi na tano kupata muda wa kusoma, au hadi uifunge. Ya dharura daima inasubiri kufungwa, ili onyo lisijiondoe kabla halijasomwa.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-notifications-p5 = Ili kuzima arifa, fungua orodha kutoka duara la Arifa kisha ubonyeze kengele iliyo chini yake. Inakatwa kwa mstari zikiwa zimezimwa, ili uone kwa mtazamo. Zinaacha kuonekana, lakini bado zinakusanywa kwenye orodha, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachokosekana kwa kuzizima kwa saa moja. Ibonyeze tena kuziwasha.

# Help topic "Notifications: what programs tell you": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-notifications-tip6 = Msalaba kwenye arifa unaiweka kando tu. Bado iko kwenye orodha. Tiki ya kijani baada ya picha ya skrini kuhifadhiwa inaonekana mahali pale pale.

# Title of the Help topic "Getting new apps".
settings-help-topics-apps-title = Kupata programu mpya

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Getting new apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-apps-keywords = install store apps download software flathub browser firefox brave uninstall remove update deb package chrome vs code zoom driver double-click weka duka programu pakua kivinjari ondoa sasisha kifurushi dereva

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-apps-p1 = Trindle haikuchagulii programu zako. Unapoingia mara ya kwanza, Karibu inaonyesha kurasa chache za programu maarufu, kivinjari na kadhalika; chagua unazotaka kisha ubonyeze Weka programu zilizochaguliwa. Karibu iko kwenye Programu zote wakati wowote ukitaka kurasa hizo tena.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-apps-p2 = Baadaye, fungua Programu kutoka kwenye pete. Vinjari kwa aina upande wa kushoto, au tafuta juu. Bofya programu kuisoma, kisha ubonyeze mshale wa kupakua kuiweka. Nyota zake zinaonekana chini ya jina lake, picha zake zinasogea chini ya kitufe cha kuweka, na Wanachosema watu, chini zaidi, ina maoni yake; kitufe cha dunia kinafungua ukurasa wake kwenye Flathub.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (store-app.png).
settings-help-topics-apps-pic3 = Ukurasa wa programu kwenye Programu

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-1 = Ili kuondoa programu, ipate kwenye Programu kisha ubonyeze pipa mara mbili: mara ya kwanza linalijaza kwa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki, na mara ya pili inaiondoa.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-2 = Au ibofye kulia kwenye pete kisha uchague Ondoa.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-apps-step4-3 = Masasisho yanaonekana chini ya Masasisho kwenye orodha ya Programu; bonyeza kitufe cha kusasisha.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 5, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-apps-tip5 = Programu zinawekwa kwa ajili yako tu, kwa hiyo nenosiri halihitajiki.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-apps-p6 = Baadhi ya programu hazipo kwenye Flathub na zinachapishwa kwenye GitHub badala yake, kama AppImage au faili ya Flatpak. Chagua Kutoka GitHub kwenye orodha ya Programu kisha uandike jina: AppImage zilizoorodheshwa kwenye AppImageHub zinaonekana unapoandika, na kubonyeza Enter kunatafuta GitHub yote. Jicho linaonyesha faili za toleo jipya la programu; mshale wa kupakua unaiweka mara moja.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 7, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-tip7 = Hakuna anayekagua programu za GitHub kama Flathub inavyokagua zake. Weka tu kutoka kwa watu unaowaamini.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 8.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-p8 = Kitufe kidogo cha ufunguo cha duara upande wa mwisho wa kadi ya Tafuta GitHub kinafungua kisanduku cha ufunguo wa GitHub. Karibu hakika huuhitaji. Bila huo GitHub hujibu maswali 60 kwa saa kutoka kwenye kompyuta yako; ukiwa nao hujibu 5,000, jambo linalohusika tu ukitafuta sana. Trindle huhifadhi majibu ya GitHub kwa saa chache, kwa hiyo kutafuta kitu kile kile tena hakutumii hata moja, na kikomo kikifikiwa ukurasa unasema GitHub itajibu lini tena. Ufunguo unaiacha Trindle kuangalia faili za umma tu na si kingine: haupe njia ya kuingia kwenye akaunti yako, na huchagui ruhusa zozote unapoutengeneza.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": paragraph 9.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-p9 = Baadhi ya watengenezaji hutoa programu yao kama kifurushi cha Debian, faili inayoishia .deb: Google Chrome, VS Code, Zoom na madereva mengi ya printa huja hivi. Ikishapakuliwa, ibofye mara mbili kwenye Folders, au ifungue kutoka kwenye vipakuliwa vya kivinjari. Dirisha dogo linasema ni nini, toleo lake na kama tayari unayo; bonyeza mshale wa kupakua kisha utoe nenosiri lako, na kingine chochote inachohitaji kinaingia nayo. Ikiwa ina programu, programu inaonekana kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Getting new apps": tip 10, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-apps-tip10 = Kifurushi kinaweza kubadilisha chochote kwenye kompyuta, kwa hiyo weka tu vile vya watengenezaji unaowaamini.

