# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-p1 = Programu chache hazipo kwenye Flathub na zinatoka kwenye vyanzo vya Debian vya watengenezaji wake wenyewe, au zinakuja kwa matoleo mapya zaidi kutoka huko: Claude, ChatGPT na Codex, Tailscale, Syncthing, Jellyfin, Node.js, GitHub CLI na Docker. Chochote kilichopo kwenye Flathub, vivinjari vikiwemo, kinatoka Programu kama kawaida. Kwenye Programu, chagua Vyanzo vya programu kisha ubonyeze alama ya kujumlisha kando ya kimoja. Baada ya nenosiri la msimamizi wako, chanzo kinaongezwa na programu kuwekwa; kuanzia hapo inasasishwa pamoja na masasisho ya Debian.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-p2 = Chanzo kinaweza kuweka masasisho kwa kompyuta nzima, kwa hiyo ongeza watengenezaji unaowaamini tu. Pipa linaondoa programu na chanzo chake pamoja.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-sources-p3 = Kwa Tailscale, bonyeza kitufe cha kuingia mara itakapowekwa: ukurasa wa kuingia wa Tailscale unafunguka kwenye kivinjari, na Programu inasema ukiwa umeunganishwa.

# Help topic "Programs from their makers: Claude, ChatGPT, Tailscale and more": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-sources-tip4 = Ongeza chanzo kingine kinakubali chanzo cha mtengenezaji yeyote kutoka kwenye maelekezo yake ya kuweka: anwani yake, suite, components na ufunguo wa kusaini.

# Title of the Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots".
settings-help-topics-snapshots-title = Kutengua sasisho kwa snapshots

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-keywords = snapshots snapshot restore undo rollback roll back update broke boot menu grub btrfs rudisha tengua sasisho liharibika menyu ya kuwasha

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-p1 = Mfumo ukiwa kwenye Btrfs, snapshot yake inachukuliwa kabla na baada ya kila badiliko la programu: kuweka, kusasisha au kuondoa chochote kutoka Debian au chanzo cha programu. Mipangilio, Snapshots inaziorodhesha. Kamera inachukua moja sasa, kabla ya kujaribu kitu unachoweza kutaka kutengua.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Snapshots.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-2 = Bonyeza mshale wa kurejesha kando ya snapshot ya kabla mambo hayajaharibika, na tena ili kuhakikisha.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-step2-3 = Washa upya. Mfumo uko kama ulivyokuwa wakati huo; kilichokuwepo sasa hivi kimewekwa kando, hakijafutwa.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-p3 = Kompyuta isipoanza, chagua Trindle snapshots kwenye menyu ya kuwasha, kisha snapshot. Inaanza kama ilivyokuwa wakati huo, na hakuna kilichofanywa pale kinachohifadhiwa; irejeshe kwenye Mipangilio ili kukihifadhi.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-snapshots-tip4 = Menyu ya kuwasha imefichwa. Gusa Esc mara moja kompyuta inapoanza ili kuionyesha. Kushikilia Esc kunapita hadi skrini ya kuandika: andika normal kisha ubonyeze Enter kurudisha menyu.

# Help topic "Undoing an update with snapshots": tip 5, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-snapshots-tip5 = Trindle ilipowekwa kwa kisakinishi chake, folda yako ya nyumbani ina sehemu yake ya diski na imeachwa nje ya snapshots, kwa hiyo kurejesha hakubadilishi faili zako kamwe. Mipangilio, Snapshots inasema hivyo kama kompyuta hii imepangwa tofauti.

# Title of the Help topic "Moving to another computer".
settings-help-topics-moving-title = Kuhamia kompyuta nyingine

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Moving to another computer" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-moving-keywords = backup back up restore move new computer transfer copy settings apps data flat fmpack hifadhi rudufu rejesha hamia kompyuta mpya nakili mipangilio programu data

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-moving-p1 = Kwenye Programu, chagua Hamisha programu zako. Washa cha kuchukua: programu zako, data zake, AppImage zako na mipangilio ya Trindle. Bonyeza kitufe cha kuhifadhi na faili moja ya hifadhi rudufu inatengenezwa kwenye folda yako ya nyumbani; iiname kwenye USB au hifadhi ya wingu.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-moving-p2 = Kwenye kompyuta nyingine, fungua ukurasa ule ule, bonyeza kitufe cha kufungua kisha uchague faili. Programu zinawekwa upya kutoka Flathub, na data zake na mipangilio yako zinarudishwa. Toka kisha uingie tena ili kuona kila mpangilio.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-moving-p3 = Hifadhi rudufu ni aina ile ile ya faili ambayo Trindle Flat hutengeneza (inaishia .fmpack), kwa hiyo Trindle Flat inaweza kuifungua kwenye kompyuta yoyote ya Linux, na hifadhi rudufu au orodha ya programu iliyotengenezwa na Trindle Flat inaweza kuchaguliwa hapa. Jina lake kwenye ukurasa ni kiungo cha tovuti yake. Programu zilizopo tayari kwenye kompyuta hii zinabaki na mipangilio yake; ni programu inazoweka tu zinazopata mipangilio yake tena.

# Help topic "Moving to another computer": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-moving-tip4 = Hati zako, picha na faili nyingine hazimo kwenye hifadhi rudufu: ziiname mwenyewe. Manenosiri ya Wi-Fi na ufunguo wako wa GitHub pia hubaki nyuma.

# Title of the Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi".
settings-help-topics-wifi-title = Kuunganisha kwenye Wi-Fi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-wifi-keywords = wifi wi-fi wireless internet network connect password ethernet cable mtandao unganisha nenosiri kebo intaneti

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-wifi-step1-1 = Fungua pete kisha ubofye aikoni ya mtandao katikati, au fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Mtandao.

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-wifi-step1-2 = Hakikisha swichi ya Wi-Fi imewashwa.

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-wifi-step1-3 = Tafuta mtandao wako kwenye orodha kisha ubonyeze Unganisha.

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-wifi-step1-4 = Andika nenosiri la Wi-Fi kisha ubonyeze Jiunge.

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (settings-network.png).
settings-help-topics-wifi-pic2 = Ukurasa wa Mtandao

# Help topic "Connecting to Wi-Fi": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-wifi-tip3 = Mtandao uliojiunga nao awali unaunganishwa wenyewe. Bonyeza Sahau mara mbili ili kuzuia hilo.

# Title of the Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone".
settings-help-topics-sound-title = Sauti, spika na kipaza sauti

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-sound-keywords = sound audio volume speakers headphones microphone mic mute test quiet loud switcher ring input output sauti spika vipokea sauti kipaza sauti nyamazisha jaribio

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-sound-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Sauti. Chagua spika au vipokea sauti vya kutumia chini ya Towe, na kipaza sauti chini ya Ingizo.

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (settings-audio.png).
settings-help-topics-sound-pic2 = Ukurasa wa Sauti

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-sound-step3-1 = Bonyeza Cheza sauti ya majaribio kusikia kengele fupi kupitia spika zilizochaguliwa.

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-sound-step3-2 = Ongea, kisha utazame upau wa Kiwango ukisogea kuhakikisha kipaza sauti kinakusikia.

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-sound-step3-3 = Buruta kitelezi cha Sauti, au uwashe Nyamazisha.

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-sound-p4 = Ili kubadilisha sauti au kipaza sauti bila kufungua Mipangilio, bofya aikoni ya sauti katikati ya pete. Paneli yake ya duara inakuwezesha kubadilisha sauti au kipaza sauti.

# Help topic "Sound, speakers and microphone": tip 5, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-sound-tip5 = Kusogeza juu ya aikoni ya sauti kwenye pete pia kunabadilisha sauti.

# Title of the Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery".
settings-help-topics-sounds-title = Sauti za kuingia, chaja na betri

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-sounds-keywords = sounds chime startup login logout shut down charger plugged unplugged battery alert off quiet change sauti kengele kuingia kutoka zima chaja betri onyo kimya badilisha

# Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-sounds-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Sauti. Kila tukio lina sauti yake: kuingia; kutoka, kuwasha upya na kuzima; chaja ikichomekwa; chaja ikitolewa; na betri ikiisha.

# Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-sounds-step2-1 = Chagua sauti nyingine kutoka kwenye orodha kando ya tukio; inachezwa ili uisikie.

# Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-sounds-step2-2 = Chagua Zima ili kulinyamazisha tukio hilo.

# Help topic "Sounds for logging in, the charger and the battery": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-sounds-step2-3 = Bofya spika kusikia sauti tena.

# Title of the Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards".
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-title = Vipokea sauti, vipanya na kibodi za Bluetooth

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-keywords = bluetooth pair headphones earbuds mouse keyboard speaker connect oanisha vipokea sauti kipanya kibodi spika unganisha

# Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-step1-1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Bluetooth. Hakikisha Bluetooth imewashwa.

# Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-step1-2 = Weka kifaa chako kwenye hali ya kuoanisha (angalia maelekezo yake).

# Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-step1-3 = Bonyeza Tafuta, kisha ubonyeze Oanisha kando ya kifaa chako kinapoonekana.

# Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 1.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-step1-4 = Kifaa kingine kikionyesha namba, hakikisha inalingana kisha ubonyeze Ndiyo.

# Help topic "Bluetooth headphones, mice and keyboards": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (settings-bluetooth.png).
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-pic2 = Ukurasa wa Bluetooth

# Title of the Help topic "Screen size and displays".
settings-help-topics-display-title = Ukubwa wa skrini na maonyesho

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Screen size and displays" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-display-keywords = screen display size bigger smaller text zoom scale resolution monitor rotate night light warm blue light evening eyes skrini onyesho ukubwa kubwa ndogo maandishi kuza mwonekano mzunguko mwanga wa usiku joto mwanga wa buluu jioni macho

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-display-p1 = Vitu vikionekana vidogo mno au vikubwa mno, fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Onyesho, halafu ubadilishe Ukubwa. 100% ni ukubwa wa kawaida unaofaa kwa skrini yako.

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": caption and spoken name of picture 2 (settings-display.png).
settings-help-topics-display-pic2 = Ukurasa wa Onyesho

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-display-p3 = Baada ya badiliko, ujumbe unauliza kama uendelee nalo. Usipofanya chochote kwa sekunde kumi na tano skrini inarudi ilivyokuwa, kwa hiyo chaguo baya haliwezi kukukwamisha kamwe.

# Help topic "Screen size and displays": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-display-p4 = Mwanga wa usiku, chini ya ukurasa huo huo, unaifanya skrini iwe na joto zaidi jioni, ikiwa na mwanga mdogo wa buluu unaoweka macho yakiwa macho. Ukiuwasha unafuata machweo na macheo, yanayokokotolewa kutoka kwenye saa za eneo lako, kwa hiyo hakuna anayeuliza uko wapi. Chagua Weka nyakati badala yake ili kuchagua unapoanza na kuisha, na usogeze Joto kulia kwa skrini yenye joto zaidi.

# Title of the Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster".
settings-help-topics-nvidia-title = Picha za NVIDIA, na kuzifanya ziwe za kasi zaidi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-keywords = nvidia graphics card driver nouveau open slow speed gpu secure boot proprietary geforce kadi ya picha dereva wazi polepole kasi

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p1 = Trindle inaanza kwenye kila kadi ya NVIDIA ikitumia dereva wazi inayokuja na Linux, inayoitwa nouveau. Hakuna kinachohitaji kuwekwa wala kuamuliwa: eneo-kazi linafanya kazi tangu kuanza kwa kwanza.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p2 = Kwenye kadi ya zamani hiyo ndiyo mwisho wa hadithi. Kwenye kadi ya kuanzia takriban 2022, dereva wazi haiwezi kupandisha kasi ya kadi juu ya hali ya kupumzika, kwa hiyo eneo-kazi bado linafanya kazi lakini linahisi zito na video inaweza kukwama. Dereva ya NVIDIA yenyewe inatatua hilo.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-nvidia-tip3 = Kompyuta yako ikihisi vizuri, iache ilivyo. Kubadilisha dereva ya picha ndiyo njia ya kawaida zaidi ya kuishia na skrini isiyowaka.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p4 = Ili kuweka dereva ya NVIDIA yenyewe, fungua Terminal kutoka kwenye pete kisha uandike:

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-1 = sudo apt update

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-2 = sudo apt install nvidia-driver

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-step5-3 = Usiwashe upya bado: soma sehemu inayofuata kwanza.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p6 = Debian inajenga dereva kwa kernel yako inapowekwa, jambo linalochukua dakika chache na kuvuta kikusanyaji. Inajijenga upya kila kernel inaposasishwa.

# Help topic "NVIDIA graphics, and making them faster": paragraph 10.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-nvidia-p10 = Ili kurudi kwenye dereva wazi wakati wowote: sudo apt remove nvidia-driver, kisha uwashe upya.

# Title of the Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking".
settings-help-topics-magnifier-title = Kukuza skrini mahali unapotazama

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-keywords = magnifier magnify zoom bigger larger reading glasses eyesight sight small print loupe accessibility kikuza kuza kubwa kusoma miwani macho uwezo wa kuona maandishi madogo

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-p1 = Kikuza kinaonyesha duara la skrini iliyokuzwa popote unapobonyeza, ili usome maandishi madogo bila kubadilisha chochote kuhusu skrini yenyewe.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-1 = Bofya duara la Kikuza kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-2 = Shikilia kidole, au kitufe cha kipanya, popote kwenye skrini. Duara linaonekana na kila kilicho chini yake kimekuzwa.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-3 = Endelea kushikilia na usogee: duara linafuata, ili uweze kusoma kwenye mstari.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-step2-4 = Achia na duara linatoweka. Bonyeza kitufe tena ukimaliza.

# Help topic "Making the screen bigger where you are looking": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-magnifier-tip3 = Kikuza kikiwa kimewashwa, skrini iliyo chini inashikiliwa tuli na haiwezi kubonyezwa, kwa hiyo huwezi kuanzisha kitu kwa bahati mbaya ukisoma.

# Title of the Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen".
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-title = Kuchukua rangi kutoka kwenye skrini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-keywords = eye dropper eyedropper colour color pick picker hex code copy swatch screen kidondoshi rangi chukua msimbo nakili skrini

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-p1 = Kidondoshi cha rangi kinasoma rangi ya nukta yoyote moja kwenye skrini na kunakili msimbo wake, kama #FBC711, ili uweze kuubandika kwenye hati au muundo.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-1 = Bofya duara la Kidondoshi cha rangi kwenye pete, lile lenye kidondoshi juu yake.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-2 = Skrini inashikiliwa tuli, ikiwa na duara lililokuzwa karibu na kielekezi ili uweze kulenga nukta moja.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-3 = Bofya nukta unayotaka. Bonyeza Esc ukitaka kuacha.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-step2-4 = Msimbo unanakiliwa mara moja na kuwekwa juu ya orodha, mpya kwanza.

# Help topic "Picking a colour from the screen": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-eye-dropper-tip3 = Rangi zilizochukuliwa awali zinabaki kwenye orodha, kwa hiyo unaweza kunakili moja tena baadaye bila kuichukua upya.

# Title of the Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen".
settings-help-topics-screenshots-title = Kupiga picha ya skrini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-keywords = screenshot screen shot print prtsc super shift s picture capture grab snip area part copy paste clipboard picha ya skrini nasa eneo sehemu nakili bandika ubao wa kunakili

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-p1 = Bonyeza kitufe cha Print, au Super, Shift na S kwenye kibodi isiyo nacho, au bofya duara la Picha ya skrini (kamera) kwenye pete, ambalo hujifunga kwanza ili lisiwe kwenye picha, na skrini inashikiliwa tuli, hafifu kidogo. Buruta kwenye sehemu unayotaka, au tumia vitufe viwili vya duara chini: skrini nzima, au funga. Pumzika juu ya kitufe kuona jina lake.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-1 = Kwa skrini nzima, bonyeza kitufe cha skrini.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-2 = Kwa sehemu, bonyeza mraba wa vitone, kisha uburute kwenye sehemu unayotaka. Inapigwa unapoachia.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-step2-3 = Umebadili mawazo? Bonyeza msalaba, au Esc.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-p3 = Picha inahifadhiwa kwenye Picha, ndani ya folda iitwayo Screenshots, ikipewa jina la tarehe na saa. Pia inanakiliwa, ili uweze kuibandika moja kwa moja kwenye barua pepe au hati, na tiki ya kijani inaonekana kwa muda mfupi ukingoni mwa skrini, ambapo arifa zinaonekana.

# Help topic "Taking a picture of the screen": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-screenshots-tip4 = Shift na Print inapiga skrini nzima mara moja, bila kuuliza.

# Title of the Help topic "Having the screen read aloud".
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-title = Kusomewa skrini kwa sauti

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Having the screen read aloud" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-keywords = screen reader blind read aloud speak speech voice sight eyesight accessibility kisomaji cha skrini kipofu soma kwa sauti sema usemi sauti kuona

# Help topic "Having the screen read aloud": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-p1 = Kisomaji cha skrini cha Trindle chenyewe na sauti yake vinaandaliwa. Bado hakuna kilichowekwa, kwa hiyo swichi kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano, chini ya Ufikivu, imefifishwa na inasema hivyo.

# Help topic "Having the screen read aloud": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-screen-reader-p2 = Kitakapokuwa tayari, Super, Alt na S pamoja zitakiwasha na kukizima kutoka popote, hata wakati wa kuanza kwa kwanza kabisa, bila kitu cha kuona wala kubofya. Hadi hapo vitufe hivyo vinafungua Mipangilio kwenye mstari huo.

# Title of the Help topic "Wallpaper".
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-title = Mandhari

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Wallpaper" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-keywords = wallpaper background picture photo slideshow change tiles pictures folder add remove skip mandhari usuli picha badilisha vigae folda ongeza ondoa ruka

# Help topic "Wallpaper": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Mandhari. Picha zinazokuja na Trindle zinaonyeshwa kama vigae vidogo, na ile iliyo kwenye skrini sasa hivi kwenye onyesho kubwa upande wa kulia.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-1 = Bonyeza kigae ili kuweka picha hiyo kwenye skrini.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-2 = Kibonyeze tena ili kuiacha nje: kigae kinafifia, na picha hiyo inarukwa kuanzia hapo. Bonyeza mara moja zaidi kuirudisha.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-3 = Ongeza yako mwenyewe kwa Ongeza picha, au uielekeze Trindle kwenye folda yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-step2-4 = Washa Badilisha picha ili ibadilike yenyewe, kisha useme mara ngapi. Ni picha zilizobaki zikiwaka tu ndizo zinazotumika.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-tip3 = Kuacha picha nje hakuifuti kamwe. Kigae kinabaki pale, kimefifia, ili ubadili mawazo.

# Help topic "Wallpaper": caption and spoken name of picture 4 (settings-wallpaper.png).
settings-help-topics-wallpaper-pic4 = Ukurasa wa Mandhari

