# Words people might search for the Help topic "Colours, icons and text" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-look-keywords = colour colours color colors accent theme dark light mode sunshine bright font text icons cursor pointer look rangi mandhari-mada giza angavu jua fonti maandishi aikoni kielekezi mwonekano

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-look-p1 = Fungua Mipangilio kisha uchague Mwonekano. Chini ya Mada, mada yenye sura ya giza na ya angavu ina vitufe viwili kando ya picha yake, Giza na Angavu. Bonyeza Angavu skrini ikiwa ngumu kuona kwenye jua kali, na Giza tena baadaye; kila kitu kinabadilika mara moja, programu zilizowekwa kutoka Programu zitabadilika zitakapofunguliwa mara ijayo. Mada yenye sura moja, kama Midnight, ambayo ni nyeusi, au Paper, ambayo ni angavu, haina vitufe hivyo: ili kubadilisha kati ya giza na angavu hapo, chagua mada nyingine.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-look-p2 = Rangi ya kuangazia hutumika kwa vitufe, swichi na mahali ulipo; chagua mojawapo ya rangi kumi au andika yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (settings-appearance.png).
settings-help-topics-look-pic3 = Ukurasa wa Mwonekano

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-look-p4 = Chini ya Aikoni, chagua Duara au Miraba. Zote ni Aikoni za Trindle: alama ya kila programu kwa nyeupe juu ya rangi yake yenyewe, ya duara au kwenye mraba wenye pembe zilizolainishwa, sawa kwenye angavu na giza. Trindle inakuja na duara. Programu ambayo seti bado haijaichora inapata picha yake yenyewe juu ya duara au mraba mweupe, ili ibaki inafaa.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-look-p5 = Ukurasa huo huo unabadilisha fonti na ukubwa wa kielekezi, na unaweza kupokea fonti yako mwenyewe; angalia kuongeza fonti.

# Help topic "Colours, icons and text": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-look-p6 = Mada inabadilisha mwonekano wote mara moja; angalia mada. Ili kubadilisha zaidi kwa mkono, kama vivuli, pembe au usuli wa Programu, angalia kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo.

# Title of the Help topic "Adding fonts of your own".
settings-help-topics-themes-title = Kuongeza fonti zako mwenyewe

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Adding fonts of your own" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-themes-keywords = font fonts ttf otf ttc zip add upload install typeface letters fonti ongeza weka herufi

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-themes-p1 = Mipangilio, Mwonekano inaweza kupokea fonti uliyoipakua, kwa hiyo huachwi na zile zinazokuja na Trindle. Iongeze chini ya Maandishi, na inaonekana kwenye orodha ya Fonti pale.

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-themes-p2 = Fonti ni faili ya .ttf, .otf au .ttc, au zip yenye baadhi. Kila fonti inayopatikana inanakiliwa kwenye folda yako ya fonti na kisha iko kwenye orodha ya Fonti. Fonti za kompyuta nzima, kwa kila anayeitumia, zinawekwa kutoka Programu badala yake.

# Help topic "Adding fonts of your own": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-themes-tip3 = Hakuna unachoongeza kinachotumwa popote, na hakuna kilichopo tayari kwenye kompyuta kinachobadilishwa.

# Title of the Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file".
settings-help-topics-theme-files-title = Mada: mwonekano mzima kutoka faili moja

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-keywords = theme themes look skin file css add share make own glass dark light keep go back undo thirty seconds footer safe default trial mada mwonekano faili ongeza shiriki tengeneza giza angavu hifadhi rudi tengua sekunde thelathini salama chaguo-msingi jaribio

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p1 = Mada ni mwonekano mzima, rangi, pembe, ukubwa na nafasi, ukiwekwa kwenye faili moja. Mipangilio, Mwonekano, Mada inaonyesha kila mada kama picha ndogo iliyochorwa kwa rangi zake yenyewe. Mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe, usiku wa buluu nzito, daima uko wa kwanza kwenye orodha na hauwezi kuondolewa kamwe. Midnight, inayokuja na Trindle, ni nyeusi na kijivu bila buluu ndani yake, kama mwonekano wa Trindle ulivyokuwa zamani.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-1 = Bonyeza mada ili kuijaribu. Kila dirisha la Trindle linabadilika mara moja. Mada yenye sura ya giza na ya angavu ina Giza na Angavu kando ya picha yake: bonyeza mojawapo badala yake ili kujaribu mada kwa sura hiyo. Kwenye mada unayoitumia tayari, vinabadilisha sura mara moja, bila cha kuhifadhi.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-2 = Hifadhi inaulizwa kwenye kisanduku chini ya dirisha, ambacho kinabaki kikionekana hata uwe umeshuka umbali gani kwenye ukurasa. Bonyeza Hifadhi ndani ya sekunde 30 ili kuihifadhi. Usipofanya chochote, au ukibonyeza Rudi sasa au Escape, mwonekano ulioukuwa nao unarudi wenyewe, kila mahali, hata Mipangilio ikiwa imefungwa.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-step2-3 = Ili kuongeza mada aliyoshiriki mtu, bonyeza Ongeza mada kisha uchague faili yake ya .css. Inakaguliwa kwanza, na ambayo si mada inayotumika inakataliwa kwa mstari na sababu.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p3 = Faili ya mada imeandikwa kama karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe (angalia kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo): kizuizi cha :root { "{" } { "}" } chenye majina yoyote yale yale, kama --trindle-page: #101820;. Juu yake inaweza kusema ni nani, kwa --trindle-theme-name, --trindle-theme-about (mstari mmoja), --trindle-theme-author na --trindle-theme-version, na sura zipi ilizonazo kwa --trindle-theme-look: dark; light; au both;. Chochote inachoacha kinabaki kama Trindle ilivyo nacho. Mada unazoongeza zinahifadhiwa kwenye folda ya themes ndani ya folda ya trindle kwenye folda yako ya .config, na kuondoa moja kutoka hapo kunaiondoa kwenye orodha.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p4 = Mada yenye sura zote mbili inazihifadhi kwenye faili moja. Thamani zake za giza zinakwenda kwenye :root { "{" } { "}" } kama kawaida, na zile za angavu kwenye kizuizi cha pili, @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { "{" } :root { "{" } { "}" } { "}" }, kama karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe inavyofanya. Kipe kizuizi cha angavu kila rangi na kivuli ambacho sura ya giza inaweka, la sivyo za giza zitaonekana kwenye sura ya angavu. Mipangilio kisha inaonyesha Giza na Angavu kando ya picha ya mada. Mada inayosema giza au angavu ina sura hiyo moja, daima inachorwa nayo, na haina vitufe hivyo; ambayo haisemi inachukuliwa kuwa na zote mbili ikiwa na kizuizi cha angavu na kuwa ya giza ikiwa haina. Programu nyingine zinaambiwa sura ambayo mada yako inachorwa nayo kweli, kwa hiyo mada angavu inazifanya ziwe angavu.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-theme-files-p5 = Mada ni salama kujaribu, aliyeitengeneza awe yeyote. Inasomwa tu kama orodha ya thamani, haiendeshwi kamwe, na haiwezi kuleta faili nyingine wala kufikia intaneti. Ni thamani ambazo Trindle inazijua tu zinazochukuliwa, kila moja ikibaki ndani ya mipaka yake, kwa hiyo hakuna mada inayoweza kuficha kitufe, swali au onyo, au kufanya maandishi kuwa madogo mno kusomeka. Maneno yanabaki wazi vya kutosha kusomeka rangi yoyote mada inayotoa, nyekundu inabaki nyekundu, na rangi yako ya kuangazia inabaki yako. Mada inabadilisha madirisha yako tu: skrini ya kuingia daima inavaa mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe.

# Help topic "Themes: a whole look from one file": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-theme-files-tip6 = Mwonekano ukiharibika na usipate njia ya kurudi, fungua terminal, au kiweko cha maandishi kwa Ctrl, Alt na F3, kisha uandike: trindle-settings --theme default

# Title of the Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet".
settings-help-topics-theming-title = Kubadilisha mwonekano kwa karatasi ya mtindo

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-theming-keywords = theme theming style sheet stylesheet css colours colors shadows corners rounder bigger text size buttons background page store look custom own retheme mada karatasi ya mtindo rangi vivuli pembe maandishi ukubwa vitufe usuli ukurasa mwonekano

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-theming-p1 = Kila kitu ambacho Trindle inachora, rangi zake, vivuli, pembe, nafasi kati ya vitu, ukubwa wa vitufe na ukubwa na unene wa maneno, kinatoka kwenye karatasi moja ya mtindo, iliyoandikwa kama kurasa za wavuti zinavyopambwa. Wewe, au AI unayemwomba, mnaweza kubadilisha chochote kwa karatasi yako mwenyewe.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-1 = Tengeneza faili iitwayo style.css kwenye folda ya trindle ndani ya folda yako ya .config (Folders inaionyesha mara faili zilizofichwa zinapoonyeshwa).

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-2 = Weka tu unachotaka kubadilisha, ndani ya :root { "{" } { "}" }. Kwa mfano, --trindle-page: #101010; inapa kila dirisha ukurasa unaokaribia kuwa mweusi, --trindle-highlight: #4bae4f; inafanya vitufe viwe vya kijani, na --trindle-card-corner: 16; inafanya kadi ziwe na pembe za mviringo zaidi.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-theming-step2-3 = Ihifadhi. Kila dirisha la Trindle, pete na pau za vichwa vinabadilika mara moja.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-theming-p3 = Kila jina unaloweza kutumia liko kwenye karatasi ya Trindle yenyewe, /usr/share/trindle/style.css, pamoja na kile linachofanya na mipaka yake kando yake, kama (6 hadi 18). Mabadiliko ya sura ya angavu pekee yanakwenda kwenye kizuizi cha @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) { "{" } :root { "{" } { "}" } { "}" }, kama kwenye karatasi ya Trindle. Vivuli vinaandikwa kama ukurasa wa wavuti unavyoviandika, kama 0 8px 20px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8). Kadi hutoa kivuli laini mwanzoni; --trindle-card-shadow: none; inazifanya tambarare, na --trindle-edge: transparent; inaondoa ukingo wake mwembamba.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-theming-p4 = Hakuna unachoandika kinachoweza kuvunja dirisha. Majina ambayo Trindle haijui yanapuuzwa, thamani isiyoweza kuisoma inabadilishwa na ya Trindle yenyewe, na ukubwa unabaki ndani ya mipaka yake. Rangi ni juu yako: rangi unayoiweka inaachwa kama ulivyoiandika, na Trindle inasogeza maneno yake yenyewe ili yaweze kusomeka kwenye ukurasa, kadi au upau wa kichwa wako. Rangi iliyowekwa kwa sura ya angavu pekee ni yako kwenye sura ya angavu tu. Rangi inayoonekana kupitia inapimwa juu ya nyeusi na juu ya nyeupe, kwani kinachoonekana kupitia haijulikani; rangi zako mwenyewe zisipoacha kinachoweza kusomeka kwa zote, maneno ya Trindle yanaenda mbali iwezekanavyo, hadi nyeusi au nyeupe. Vitu vitatu vinabaki vikisomeka karatasi ikisema chochote: maneno mekundu yanayosema kuhusu kushindwa, maneno juu ya rangi yako ya kuangazia, na visanduku vinavyoomba nenosiri, ambavyo daima vinachorwa kwa mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe. Rangi ulizoweka zikishindwa kufikia kinachoweza kusomwa, Mipangilio, Mwonekano inasema "Baadhi ya rangi ni ngumu kusoma." na kuziacha kama ulivyoziandika. Maneno uliyoweka mwenyewe yakiwa magumu kusoma, futa faili na mwonekano wa Trindle wenyewe unarudi mara moja. Faili lazima iwe faili ya kawaida ya maneno, isiyozidi KB 256; ambayo si hivyo haitumiki, na Mipangilio, Mwonekano inasema hivyo.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-theming-p5 = Karatasi yako mwenyewe inawekwa juu ya mada yoyote iliyochaguliwa, kwa hiyo badiliko lako dogo linabaki ukibadilisha mada. Kwa mwonekano mzima wa kuhifadhi au kushiriki, tengeneza mada badala yake; angalia mada.

# Help topic "Changing the look with a style sheet": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-theming-tip6 = Rangi iliyowekwa kwenye karatasi yako kwa --trindle-highlight inashinda rangi ya kuangazia iliyochaguliwa kwenye Mipangilio, Mwonekano.

# Title of the Help topic "Voice control".
settings-help-topics-voice-title = Udhibiti wa sauti

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Voice control" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-voice-keywords = voice speak talk microphone commands whisper listen say sauti sema ongea kipaza sauti amri sikiliza

# Help topic "Voice control": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-voice-p1 = Udhibiti wa sauti ni nyongeza ya hiari. Ili kuuongeza, fungua Mipangilio, chagua Pete, kisha ubonyeze Ongeza sauti. Inachukua dakika chache na takriban MB 150.

# Help topic "Voice control": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-voice-p2 = Kisha fungua pete, gusa katikati yake popote pasipo na kitufe, kisha uongee. Inaacha kusikiliza yenyewe ukiacha kuongea, au gusa tena. Inafanya kazi kwa kidole pamoja na kipanya. Mambo unayoweza kusema:

# Help topic "Voice control": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-1 = Jina la programu, kama “Firefox” au “folders”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-2 = “Badilisha kwenda” programu, au “funga dirisha”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-3 = “Sauti juu”, “sauti chini”, “nyamazisha”.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-4 = “Mipangilio ya Wi-Fi”, “mipangilio ya betri”, au ukurasa mwingine wowote wa mipangilio.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-5 = “Weka” na jina la programu, ili kuitafuta kwenye Programu.

# Help topic "Voice control": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 3.
settings-help-topics-voice-step3-6 = “Mandhari inayofuata”, “picha ya skrini”, “saa ngapi”.

# Help topic "Voice control": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-voice-tip4 = Sauti yako inaeleweka kwenye kompyuta hii. Hakuna kinachotumwa popote. Sauti inaweza kuzimwa kwenye ukurasa wa Pete bila kuiondoa.

# Title of the Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones".
settings-help-topics-files-title = Folders, vifaa vya USB na simu

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-files-keywords = folders files file manager usb stick drive phone camera nas network share sharing samba disks eject format extract unpack zip compress archive rar 7z tar iso disc image password terminal f4 root wallpaper copy path location preview space bar emblem badge resize rotate picture columns music photo pdf keys keyboard shortcuts tab tabs new window faili kidhibiti cha faili simu kamera mtandao shiriki diski toa fomati fungua zip bana hifadhi nenosiri mandhari nakili njia eneo hakiki picha safu muziki njia za mkato kichupo dirisha jipya

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-files-p1 = Folders ni kidhibiti cha faili, mojawapo ya programu zilizo kuzunguka pete. Vifaa vya USB, simu na kamera vilivyochomekwa vinaonekana upande wake wa kushoto, na pia folda zilizoshirikiwa kwenye mtandao wako wa nyumbani chini ya Mtandao.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-files-p2 = Folders inafunguka na kidirisha kimoja kinachoonyesha folda yako ya Nyumbani, na Vilivyopakuliwa na Hati vimebandikwa upande wa kushoto. Swichi ya Kimoja na Viwili juu kushoto (au F3) inaongeza kidirisha cha pili, kinachoonyesha Za hivi karibuni isipokuwa uchague mahali pengine kwenye mipangilio ya Folders yenyewe, nyuma ya gia mwishoni mwa upau wake wa juu (au Ctrl na koma): kila kidirisha kinapoanzia, visanduku vya kuchagua, viendelezi vya faili, na kama kifaa cha hifadhi kinafunguliwa kinapochomekwa. Kila kidirisha kina safu yake ya vichupo juu ya orodha yake. Upau wa juu unabakiza tu kinachobadilisha jinsi folda inavyoonekana, pamoja na Tengua na Folda mpya; kila kinachofanya kazi kwenye ulichochagua, kama Badilisha jina, Kata, Nakili, Hamisha kwenye Tupio, Futa kabisa na Futa kwa usalama, kiko kwenye menyu ya kubofya kulia, na kila kimoja bado kina kitufe chake.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-files-p3 = Kwenye menyu ya kubofya kulia, Fungua kwa programu nyingine inaorodhesha programu zinazoweza kufungua faili: bofya mara mbili moja, au bonyeza Enter juu yake, ili kufungua faili nayo mara moja. Tiki inafanya vivyo hivyo.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-files-p4 = Unapochomeka kifaa cha USB au kadi ya kumbukumbu, pete inasema hivyo kwa mstari mmoja na neno Fungua. Fungua linaonyesha faili zake kwenye Folders, likiuliza kaulisiri kwanza ikiwa imefungwa. Folders inakiorodhesha chini ya Vifaa vya hifadhi ukibonyeza Fungua au la, kikiwa kimeunganishwa au la, na kitufe cha duara cha Toa kinachokiweka kando kwa usalama. “Fungua vifaa vya hifadhi vikichomekwa”, kwenye mipangilio ya Folders yenyewe chini ya Vifaa vya hifadhi, hufanya ufunguzi kwa ajili yako. Kifaa kilichochomekwa skrini ikiwa imefungwa kinasubiri hadi uifungue.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p5 = Bofya kulia kwenye Folders kupata zaidi: Toa hapa na Toa kwenye folda kwa kumbukumbu zilizobanwa, Bana kutengeneza .zip au .tar, Fungua kwenye Terminal, Fungua kama Root, Nakili eneo, na Weka kama mandhari kwenye picha. Folders inafungua kumbukumbu zilizobanwa yenyewe: bofya mara mbili .zip, .7z, .rar au .tar, taswira ya diski (.iso) au karibu aina nyingine yoyote nayo inafunguka kama folda, ili uweze kuangalia ndani na kutoa unachotaka tu. .zip au .7z iliyofungwa kwa nenosiri inaliomba; Folders haihifadhi nenosiri, kwa hiyo inaliuliza tena mara ijayo. .rar iliyofungwa kwa nenosiri haiwezi kufunguliwa, na Folders inakuambia hivyo.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 6.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p6 = Bonyeza upau wa nafasi kwenye faili ili kuitazama bila kuifungua, na tena ili kuifunga. F4 inafungua terminal kwenye folda uliyomo. Bofya kulia folda au faili kisha uchague Bandika kwenye pete ili kuiweka kuzunguka katikati ya pete pamoja na programu zako pendwa, ambapo kubofya mara moja kunaifungua; ibofye kulia hapo ili kuiondoa. Bofya kulia picha ili kubadilisha ukubwa au kuzungusha. Sifa za faili zinaweza kuipa alama ndogo, na za folda zinaweza kuishiriki na kompyuta nyingine kwenye mtandao wako wa nyumbani: mara ya kwanza, Folders inawasha Samba, ambayo inaomba nenosiri lako, na kushiriki kunafanya kazi baada ya kompyuta kuwashwa upya. Kwenye mwonekano wa orodha, bofya kulia vichwa vya safu ili kuongeza maelezo ya muziki, picha na PDF.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 7.
settings-help-topics-files-p7 = Kila jina kwenye njia iliyo juu lina mshale mdogo baada yake: ubonyeze kupata orodha ya folda zilizo ndani ya folda hiyo, kisha uchague moja ili kwenda huko. Kubofya kwa kati kwenye folda, au Ctrl na kubofya mara mbili, kunaifungua kwenye kichupo kipya nyuma ya kile ulichopo, na kubofya kwa kati kwenye kichupo kunakifunga. Buruta folda kati ya folda mbili zilizobandikwa upande wa kushoto ili kuibandika hapo, na uburute folda zilizobandikwa juu na chini ili kuzipanga upendavyo. Chini ya kisanduku cha Tafuta kuna orodha tatu, Aina, Ukubwa na Ilibadilishwa, zinazopunguza kinachoonyeshwa mara tu unapochagua.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 8.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p8 = Vitufe ni vile vya kawaida vya kidhibiti cha faili. Alt na Kushoto zinarudi nyuma, Alt na Kulia mbele, na Alt na Juu au Backspace juu folda moja. Ctrl na L, au Alt na D, zinakuwezesha kuandika mahali. Ctrl na T inafungua kichupo, Ctrl na W inakifunga (na dirisha, likiwa la mwisho), Ctrl na Tab inaenda kwenye kichupo kinachofuata na Ctrl, Shift na Tab kwenye kilichotangulia. Ctrl na N inafungua dirisha jingine. Ctrl na F inatafuta, F2 inabadilisha jina, F5 inasoma folda tena, Delete inahamisha kwenye Tupio na Shift na Delete inafuta kabisa. Ctrl, Shift na N inatengeneza folda. Ctrl na A inachagua yote, Ctrl, Shift na A hakuna, na Ctrl na I inageuza uchaguzi. Alt na Enter inafungua Sifa. F3 inabadilisha kati ya kidirisha kimoja na viwili, na F4 inafungua terminal.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": paragraph 9.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-files-p9 = Vifaa vya hifadhi, kwenye Programu zote na kwenye Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii, vinaonyesha kila kifaa na nafasi iliyobaki. Kutoka hapo unaweza kufungua kifaa cha USB, kukitoa kwa usalama kabla ya kukichomoa, au kukifomati. Kifaa ambacho mfumo unaendeshwa juu yake hakitolewi kamwe kwa kufomatiwa.

# Help topic "Folders, USB sticks and phones": caption and spoken name of picture 10 (settings-disks.png).
settings-help-topics-files-pic10 = Dirisha la Vifaa vya hifadhi

