# Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-appimages-p1 = Baadhi ya programu zinapakuliwa kutoka kwenye tovuti za watengenezaji wake kama faili moja inayoishia .AppImage. Fungua Programu, chagua Zilizowekwa kisha ubonyeze alama ya kujumlisha kando ya Ongeza AppImage, kisha uchague faili. Inanakiliwa kwenye folda ya .appimage kwenye nyumbani kwako, na inaonekana kwenye pete na jina lake na picha yake.

# Help topic "Apps that come as an AppImage": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-appimages-p2 = Imeorodheshwa kwenye ukurasa ule ule pamoja na kila programu nyingine; ili kuiondoa, bonyeza pipa lake mara mbili. Nakala uliyopakua inaachwa ilipo.

# Title of the Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps".
settings-help-topics-older-programs-title = Programu za zamani: Steam, michezo ya Wine na programu za Java

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-older-programs-keywords = older programs x11 xwayland steam wine games java old apps allow switch watch spy programu za zamani michezo ruhusu swichi tazama pelelezi

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-older-programs-p1 = Programu nyingi kwenye Trindle huchora madirisha yake kwa njia mpya. Baadhi ya programu za zamani, kama Steam na michezo yake, michezo ya Wine na programu za Java, bado huyachora kwa njia ya zamani, kupitia msaidizi anayeitwa Xwayland. Kwenye eneo-kazi nyingine kila programu ya zamani inashiriki msaidizi mmoja, kwa hiyo yoyote kati yao inaweza kutazama madirisha ya zingine na unachoandika ndani yake.

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-older-programs-p2 = Trindle inapa kila programu ya zamani uliyoiweka kwenye folda yake yenyewe, na kila programu ya Flathub inayoihitaji, msaidizi wake mwenyewe, kwa hiyo hakuna inayoweza kuona nyingine. Programu zilizowekwa kwa kompyuta nzima zinashiriki mmoja. Msaidizi anaanza tu programu ya zamani inapofunguka na anaacha inapofungwa, kwa hiyo hatumii kumbukumbu wakati mwingine.

# Help topic "Older programs: Steam, Wine games and Java apps": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-older-programs-tip3 = Usipotumia programu za zamani kamwe, unaweza kuzizima kwenye Mipangilio, Ruhusa, kwa Ruhusu programu za zamani. Ikiwa imezimwa hazifunguki.

