# Title of the Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down".
settings-help-topics-power-title = Betri, kulala na kuzima

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-power-keywords = battery power charge sleep suspend shut down turn off restart log out screen betri nishati chaji lala simamisha zima washa upya toka skrini

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-power-p1 = Mipangilio, Nishati inaonyesha betri, hali ya nishati, na baada ya muda gani, ukiwa mbali, skrini inafifia, inafungwa, inazimwa na kompyuta inalala. Kufunga skrini kukishawashwa (angalia hapa chini), Super na L pamoja zinaifunga mara moja.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-power-p2 = Kufunga skrini kumezimwa mwanzoni. Washa Funga skrini chini ya Kufunga kwenye ukurasa huo huo, kisha uchague kompyuta iachwe peke yake kwa muda gani kabla ya kufunga: ikilala tu, au kuanzia dakika 1 hadi saa 2. Nenosiri lako linaifungua. Ukipenda, ongeza pia PIN ya tarakimu nne, ambayo ni ya haraka zaidi; chagua PIN inafanya kazi kwa muda gani baada ya kufunga, kuanzia dakika 15 hadi saa 2. Baada ya muda huo, au baada ya majaribio matano yasiyo sahihi, inaomba nenosiri lako. Ikifungwa kwa sababu iliachwa peke yake, skrini inaonyesha saa tu, ikielea, hadi urudi; hakuna kilicho kwenye skrini yako kinachoonekana hadi urudi ndani. Kuingia daima kunahitaji nenosiri lako.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": caption and spoken name of picture 3 (settings-power.png).
settings-help-topics-power-pic3 = Ukurasa wa Nishati

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-power-p4 = Betri inapofikia 10%, onyo linaonekana katikati ya skrini, mara moja, na sauti. Chagua kiwango kingine, au Kamwe, chini ya Onya betri ikifikia. Kuchomeka chaja au kuichomoa kunaonyesha kadi kwa sekunde chache, na sauti, ili waya unaotoka ugundulike.

# Help topic "Battery, sleep and shutting down": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-power-p5 = Ili kutoka, kuwasha upya au kuzima, fungua pete kisha ubofye kitufe cha nishati katikati yake. Chaguo zinafunika katikati. Funga skrini na Kihifadhi skrini vinatokea mara moja; Simamisha, Hibernate, Toka, Washa upya na Zima vinauliza mara mbili, vikijaa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki kwa kubofya kwa kwanza, ili kubofya kwa bahati mbaya kusimalize chochote. Msalaba unarudi nyuma.

# Title of the Help topic "Apps that start by themselves".
