# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-startup-p1 = Mipangilio, Kuanza ukiingia inaorodhesha programu zinazofunguka zenyewe unapoingia.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-1 = Ili kuongeza moja, bonyeza kitufe cha gridi na uchague kutoka kwenye programu zilizowekwa, au bonyeza kitufe cha terminal ili kuandika amri au kuchagua programu kwenye diski.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-2 = Kila moja ina ucheleweshaji: Mara moja, au baada ya sekunde chache, kwa programu inayohitaji mtandao au programu nyingine iwe tayari kwanza.

# Help topic "Apps that start by themselves": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-startup-step2-3 = Swichi inaiweka programu kwenye orodha lakini inaizuia kuanza; pipa linaiondoa.

# Title of the Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts".
settings-help-topics-keys-title = Njia za mkato za kibodi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-keys-keywords = keys keyboard shortcuts super windows key alt tab screenshot print volume brightness lock terminal close maximise screen reader desktop show vitufe kibodi njia za mkato picha ya skrini sauti mwangaza funga kuza kisomaji cha skrini eneo-kazi onyesha

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-keys-p1 = Kila kitu kinaweza kufanywa kwa kipanya; vitufe hivi ni njia za haraka zaidi tu. Super ni kitufe chenye alama ya Windows kwenye kibodi nyingi.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-1 = Super peke yake, au Super na Space: fungua au funga pete.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-2 = Super na Enter, au Ctrl, Alt na T: Terminal.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-3 = Super na I: Mipangilio.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-4 = Super na L: funga skrini, kufunga kukishawashwa kwenye Mipangilio, Nishati.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-5 = Super, Alt na S: washa au zima kusomewa skrini kwa sauti.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-6 = Super na Q: funga dirisha lililo mbele.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 7 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-7 = Super na Juu: lifanye dirisha lijaze skrini, au rudi.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 8 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-8 = Super na Chini: liweke dirisha kando; madirisha wazi ya pete yanalirudisha.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 9 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-9 = Super na D: weka kila dirisha kando ili kuonyesha eneo-kazi, na uyarudishe.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 10 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-10 = Super na N: peleka kibodi kwenye arifa zilizo kwenye skrini; Tab inasogea kati ya vitufe vyake, Enter au Space inabonyeza kimoja, Escape inatoka.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 11 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-11 = Alt na Tab: leta kila dirisha lililofunguliwa mbele kwa zamu.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 12 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-12 = Print, au Super, Shift na S: picha ya skrini, au ya sehemu yake; Shift na Print: skrini nzima mara moja.

# Help topic "Keyboard shortcuts": step 13 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-keys-step2-13 = Vitufe vya sauti, kunyamazisha na mwangaza vinafanya kazi kama vilivyoandikwa.

# Title of the Help topic "Drives and USB sticks".
settings-help-topics-disks-title = Vifaa vya hifadhi na vifaa vya USB

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Drives and USB sticks" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-disks-keywords = drives disk disks drive usb stick memory card format wipe erase eject power off space full storage partition part resize shrink grow health smart check repair mount start-up startup fstab name folder mnt diski kifaa kadi ya kumbukumbu fomati futa toa zima nafasi jaa hifadhi sehemu ukubwa afya kagua rekebisha unganisha jina folda

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-disks-p1 = Vifaa vya hifadhi ni dirisha lake lenyewe, kwenye Programu zote, na Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii pia ina njia ya kuingia humo. Inasema kwa sentensi moja juu ni nafasi kiasi gani imebaki, ikiwa na pete kwa kila sehemu inayotumika, na inaonyesha kila kifaa kilicho ndani au kilichochomekwa kwenye kompyuta hii, kila sehemu yake imejaa kiasi gani na, kifaa kinapoweza kusema, ina afya kiasi gani na ina joto kiasi gani.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-1 = Chomeka kifaa cha USB; kinaonekana kwenye orodha.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-2 = Bonyeza folda kuona faili zake, na vitufe vya cheza na simamisha kukiunganisha na kukitenganisha.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step2-3 = Bonyeza toa kabla ya kukichomoa, ili kisipoteze chochote. Kitufe cha nishati kinazima kifaa cha USB kinachoweza kuzimwa, tayari kuchomolewa.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-disks-p3 = Penseli kando ya sehemu inafungua kinachoweza kubadilishwa kuihusu:

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-1 = Jina: inaitwaje hapa na kwenye kompyuta nyingine.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-2 = Folda: faili zake zinapoonekana, kama /mnt/backup, badala ya folda iliyopewa jina la namba yake. Iache tupu ili kompyuta ichague.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-3 = Unganisha wakati wa kuanza: tayari kila kompyuta inapoanza. Kifaa kisipokuwepo, kompyuta inaanza hata hivyo.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-4 = Ukubwa: ufanye mdogo, au mkubwa ndani ya nafasi tupu iliyo baada yake.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 5 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-5 = Hitilafu: tafuta hitilafu na uzirekebishe. Inatenganishwa wakati hili linaendeshwa.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": step 6 of the numbered steps at block 4.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-step4-6 = Fomati, na Futa sehemu hii.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": paragraph 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-p5 = Nukta tatu kando ya kifaa zinafuta kifaa chote na kukianza upya kama sehemu moja. Nafasi tupu pia ina penseli, ya kutengeneza sehemu mpya ndani yake. Chagua exFAT kwa kifaa kinachoshirikiwa na Windows na Mac, ext4 kwa kinachotumika na Linux tu, na FAT kwa kifaa kidogo au kifaa cha zamani.

# Help topic "Drives and USB sticks": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-disks-tip6 = Kufomati, kubadilisha ukubwa na kufuta vinauliza mara mbili, vikitaja kifaa na ukubwa wake, na vinaomba nenosiri lako. Kifaa ambacho kompyuta inaendeshwa kutoka kwacho hakitolewi kamwe kwa lolote kati ya hayo. Kufuta hakuwezi kutenguliwa: nakili kwanza chochote unachotaka kuhifadhi.

# Title of the Help topic "Which app opens what".
settings-help-topics-defaults-title = Programu ipi inafungua nini

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Which app opens what" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-defaults-keywords = default apps browser email open with pdf pictures music video links programu chaguo-msingi kivinjari barua pepe fungua kwa picha muziki video viungo

# Help topic "Which app opens what": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-defaults-p1 = Mipangilio, Programu chaguo-msingi inachagua programu ipi inafungua viungo vya wavuti, barua pepe, picha, muziki, video, faili za PDF na folda. Ni programu zilizowekwa na zinazoweza kufungua aina hiyo ya kitu tu zinazotolewa.

# Help topic "Which app opens what": tip 2, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-defaults-tip2 = Hakuna kivinjari cha wavuti kinachokuja na Trindle. Pata kimoja kutoka Programu kwanza, kisha kinaweza kuchaguliwa hapa.

# Title of the Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date".
settings-help-topics-updates-title = Kuiweka kompyuta kuwa ya kisasa

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-updates-keywords = update updates upgrade security new version debian trindle install firmware bios fwupd sasisha masasisho usalama toleo jipya weka

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-updates-p1 = Kila kitu kinasasishwa kutoka sehemu moja: ukurasa wa Masasisho wa Programu.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-1 = Fungua Programu kisha uchague Masasisho. Inaorodhesha programu zako, Debian na Trindle yenyewe, na idadi inayosubiri inaonyeshwa kwenye kitufe cha Programu kwenye pete.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 2.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-2 = Bonyeza kitufe cha kusasisha kwenye kila kadi. Debian na Trindle zinaomba nenosiri lako; programu hazifanyi hivyo.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 2.
settings-help-topics-updates-step2-3 = Toka kisha uingie tena baada ya sasisho la Trindle, ili toleo jipya ndilo linaloendeshwa.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": paragraph 3.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-updates-p3 = Mara kwa mara watengenezaji wa kompyuta, au wa sehemu yake kama kituo cha kuunganisha au padi ya kugusa, hutoa firmware mpya: programu zilizojengwa ndani ya vifaa vyenyewe. Kukiwa na kwa ajili ya yako, kadi ya Firmware inaonekana kwenye ukurasa huo huo ikiwa na toleo jipya kando ya kila sehemu, na kitufe chake cha kusasisha kinaomba nenosiri lako. Kompyuta inaweza kuhitaji kuwashwa upya ili kumaliza, kwa hiyo weka kazi yako ikiwa imehifadhiwa na, kwenye kompyuta mpakato, chaja ikiwa imechomekwa. Kusipokuwa na kipya, kadi haipo kabisa.

# Help topic "Keeping the computer up to date": tip 4, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-updates-tip4 = Hakuna kinachojiweka chenyewe: masasisho yanaingia tu unapobonyeza Sasisha, kwenye pete au Programu. Mipangilio, programu na faili zako zinabaki kupitia kila sasisho.

# Title of the Help topic "About Trindle".
settings-help-topics-about-title = Kuhusu Trindle

# Words people might search for the Help topic "About Trindle" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-about-keywords = about version what is debian compositor wayland smithay rust licence license gpl warranty risk who made kuhusu toleo ni nini leseni dhamana hatari nani alitengeneza

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-about-p1 = Trindle ni eneo-kazi dogo la Debian 13. Sehemu zake zote zimeandikwa kwa Rust: kikusanyaji chake cha madirisha, kinachoweka kila dirisha kwenye skrini, na programu moja kwa kila kitu kingine, pete, Mipangilio, Programu, skrini za kuingia na kufunga.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-about-p2 = Programu za GTK zinachora pau zake za vichwa zenyewe. Kwa zingine, kama terminal, programu za Qt na zile za zamani za X11, kikusanyaji kinachora upau wa kichwa chenyewe, na vitufe vya duara upande wa kulia kama madirisha ya GTK yenyewe yanavyo: mstari wa kuliweka dirisha kando, mraba wa kujaza skrini, na msalaba wa kulifunga.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-about-p3 = Trindle ni toleo endelevu: hakuna ratiba ya matoleo makubwa mara mbili kwa mwaka. Maboresho yanakuja yanapokuwa tayari, kila moja na namba yake, ambayo Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii inaonyesha pamoja na kichakataji cha kompyuta, kumbukumbu, michoro na mengineyo. Ukurasa huo pia ndipo jina la kompyuta linabadilishwa, na unahifadhi nyakati kumi za mwisho za kuanza, kuanzia kitufe cha nishati hadi skrini ya kuingia, na orodha nzima ikihifadhiwa kwenye Vilivyopakuliwa kwa kubofya. Kompyuta inachofanya sasa hivi kiko kwenye Shughuli, dirisha lake lenyewe.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-about-p4 = Programu za zamani zilizoandikwa kwa X11 badala ya Wayland pia zinafanya kazi: seva ya X wanayoihitaji, Xwayland, inaanza mara ya kwanza kati yao inapofunguka, na haitumii kumbukumbu hadi hapo.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-about-p5 = Ni programu huru chini ya Leseni ya Umma ya GNU, toleo la 3: unaweza kuitumia, kuibadilisha na kuishiriki. Inakuja bila dhamana ya aina yoyote na inatumika kwa hatari yako mwenyewe; weka nakala rudufu ya kila kitu muhimu.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-about-p6 = Tovuti ni trindle.org, na msimbo uko trindle.org/code.

# Help topic "About Trindle": paragraph 7.
settings-help-topics-about-p7 = Mipangilio, Shukrani inaorodhesha miradi ambayo Trindle imejengwa juu yake, ikiwa na kiungo cha makao ya kila mmoja, na moyo kwa wale wanaokubali michango.

# Title of the Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy".
settings-help-topics-activity-title = Kinachoendeshwa, na kwa nini kuna shughuli nyingi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-activity-keywords = activity task manager system monitor running programs processes processor cpu memory ram busy slow fan hot threads stop close frozen not responding bubbles swap temperature shughuli kidhibiti cha kazi programu zinazoendeshwa kichakataji kumbukumbu polepole feni joto simamisha funga haijibu viputo halijoto

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-activity-p1 = Shughuli ni dirisha lake lenyewe linaloonyesha kompyuta inafanya nini sasa hivi. Lifungue kutoka Programu zote, chini ya Mfumo, au kutoka Mipangilio, Kuhusu kompyuta hii.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-activity-p2 = Sentensi juu inasema mambo yalivyo, kama Kila kitu shwari, au ni programu ipi inaiweka kompyuta na shughuli nyingi. Chini yake kompyuta inachorwa kama chumba. Duara kubwa ni kumbukumbu, na kila programu ni kiputo ndani yake, kikubwa kama kumbukumbu inayoshikilia. Programu inayofanya kazi inang'aa na kupiga, kwa kasi na mwangaza zaidi kadri inavyofanya kazi kwa bidii: buluu kwa kazi kidogo, chungwa kwa kazi ngumu na nyekundu kwa kasi kamili. Kuzunguka ukingo kuna upau kwa kila uzi wa kichakataji, unaokua na kupata joto unavyozidi kuwa na shughuli.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-activity-p3 = Sehemu zote za programu zinajumlishwa, kwa hiyo Firefox ni kiputo kimoja iwe na vichupo vingapi. Viputo viwili vya kijivu tulivu vinabeba vingine: Eneo-kazi la Trindle, ambalo ni kila kitu Trindle inachoendesha ili kuwa eneo-kazi, na Linux na programu nyingine. Programu za Trindle, kama Mipangilio na Programu, zinahesabiwa kama programu, si eneo-kazi.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": paragraph 4.
settings-help-topics-activity-p4 = Pembeni, pete nne zinaonyesha kumbukumbu, kichakataji, diski na faili ya swap; kwenye kompyuta isiyo na faili ya swap ya mwisho inaonyesha halijoto ya kichakataji badala yake. Kwenye pete ya kumbukumbu, sehemu ya Trindle yenyewe iko kwa rangi ya kuangazia, na programu zako na Linux ziko kwa buluu.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 5.
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-1 = Programu ikiacha kujibu, bofya kiputo chake. Kadi inafunguka kando yake na kile inachofanya kwa namba rahisi.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-2 = Bonyeza kitufe cha kusimamisha kwenye kadi. Kinajaa rangi ya kuangazia na kuonyesha tiki.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 5.
# SAFETY: needs a human review before it ships
settings-help-topics-activity-step5-3 = Kibonyeze tena ndani ya sekunde tatu. Programu inaombwa ifunge, na chochote ambacho hakijahifadhiwa ndani yake kinaweza kupotea.

# Help topic "What is running, and why it is busy": tip 6, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-activity-tip6 = Programu za Trindle yenyewe na za mfumo hazina kitufe cha kusimamisha.

# Title of the Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine".
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-title = Kujaribu Trindle kwenye mashine pepe

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-keywords = virtual machine vm virtualbox boxes qemu kvm vmware hyper-v parallels utm slow 3d acceleration graphics mashine pepe polepole kasi ya 3d michoro

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-p1 = Trindle inaendeshwa kwenye mashine pepe, na inasema hivyo kwa upole inapoanza kwenye moja: kwenye dirisha la karibu kwenye kifaa, na mara moja kwenye arifa baada ya kuweka. Kwenye kompyuta halisi haitaji hilo kamwe.

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-p2 = Mashine pepe iliyotengenezwa bila michoro ya 3D haina chipu ya michoro ya Trindle kutumia, kwa hiyo kichakataji kinachora kila kitu badala yake. Madirisha, video na kurasa za wavuti zinahisi polepole kuliko zingekuwa kwenye kompyuta halisi, na Trindle inaacha michoro yake ya mwendo ili kusaidia. Kuwasha kasi ya 3D kwenye mipangilio ya onyesho ya mashine pepe kunaleta tofauti kubwa: kwenye VirtualBox ni Washa Kasi ya 3D, kwenye GNOME Boxes na virt-manager ni kasi ya 3D au Virtio na OpenGL.

# Help topic "Trying Trindle in a virtual machine": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-virtual-machine-tip3 = Hukumu kasi ya Trindle kwenye kompyuta halisi: ndipo ilipokusudiwa kuendeshwa.

# Title of the Help topic "If something goes wrong".
settings-help-topics-trouble-title = Kitu kikienda vibaya

# Words people might search for the Help topic "If something goes wrong" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-trouble-keywords = problem help stuck frozen crash login error broken recover terminal tatizo msaada kwama gandisha anguka kuingia hitilafu imeharibika okoa

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-trouble-p1 = Programu ikiacha kujibu, ibofye kulia kwenye pete kisha uchague Funga dirisha. Ikishindikana, au kompyuta ni polepole na hujui kwa nini, fungua Shughuli: inaonyesha kipi kina shughuli nyingi, na kitufe chake cha kusimamisha kinafunga programu.

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-trouble-p2 = Skrini ya kuingia ikishindwa kuonekana, au kuingia kunakurudisha kwayo, bonyeza Ctrl, Alt na F2 pamoja. Kuingia kwa maandishi kwa kawaida kunaonekana, ambapo unaweza kuingia na kurekebisha mambo; Ctrl, Alt na F7 inarudisha skrini ya picha.

# Help topic "If something goes wrong": tip 3, shown in a box of its own.
settings-help-topics-trouble-tip3 = Trindle inaweka rekodi ya kila kipindi kwenye .local/state/trindle/session.log kwenye folda yako ya nyumbani, inayosaidia kubaini kilichoenda vibaya.

# Title of the Help topic "A chip with no driver".
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-title = Chipu isiyo na dereva wala firmware

# Words people might search for the Help topic "A chip with no driver" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-keywords = driver firmware wifi wi-fi bluetooth sound graphics chip missing no driver mediatek mt7902 not working usb stick dereva chipu haipo haifanyi kazi sauti michoro

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p1 = Chipu inahitaji vitu viwili ili ifanye kazi: dereva kwenye kernel, ambayo ni kiini cha Linux, na kwa chipu nyingi faili ya firmware, programu ndogo ambayo chipu inapakia inapoanza. Trindle inaangalia chipu za kompyuta yako unapofungua Mipangilio na inasema hapa wakati moja haina kimojawapo.

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p2 = Chipu mpya sana inaweza kutokuwa na dereva kwenye kernel ambayo Debian inasambaza. MediaTek MT7902 ni mojawapo: dereva yake ya Wi-Fi inaonekana kwanza kwenye Linux 7.1, na firmware yake ya Bluetooth iko kwenye firmware-mediatek 20260916. Kernel mpya zaidi kwenye kisakinishi cha Trindle ina vyote viwili, kwa hiyo kuweka kutoka kisakinishi kipya zaidi kunatatua.

# Help topic "A chip with no driver": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-hardware-no-driver-p3 = Hadi hapo, kifaa cha Wi-Fi cha USB kinafanya kazi kwenye kompyuta yoyote bila maandalizi. Kichomeke nacho kinaonekana kwenye Mtandao. Hakuna kinachobadilishwa kwenye kompyuta yako na ujumbe huu.


# Title of the Help topic "Playing games".
settings-help-topics-games-title = Kucheza michezo

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Playing games" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-games-keywords = michezo mchezo kidhibiti games game steam proton windows launcher ubisoft controller gamepad anti-cheat vanguard black screen will not start crash alt-tab hdr

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-games-p1 = Steam inafanya kazi. Isakinishe kutoka Programu. Huendeshwa kama Flatpak, kwenye boksi lake lenyewe, na huchezesha michezo ya Windows kupitia Proton. Ubisoft Connect ilikaguliwa. Vizinduzi vingine kwa kawaida hufanya kazi ndani ya Steam, lakini kila kimoja kinaweza kuharibika baada ya sasisho lake. Michezo iliyotengenezwa kwa Linux, michezo ya DirectX 12 na michezo ya zamani ya biti 32 bado haijakaguliwa.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-games-p2 = Trindle huongeza kikomo cha kumbukumbu na kikomo cha faili ambavyo michezo mikubwa huhitaji. Mchezo unaoshikilia kipanya hukishikilia, na hukiachia ukibonyeza Alt-Tab. Mchezo wa skrini nzima hubaki skrini nzima nyuma ya dirisha ulilobadilisha kwenda. Skrini hubaki macho mchezo wa skrini nzima ukiwa mbele.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 3, before the numbered steps.
settings-help-topics-games-p3 = Mchezo ukikataa kuanza, jaribu haya kwa mpangilio.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 1 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-1 = Anzisha Steam upya. Ifunge kabisa na uifungue tena. Steam iliyoendeshwa kwa siku nyingi inaweza kuzuia michezo kuanza.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 2 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-2 = Subiri. Kuanza kwa kwanza kwa mchezo hujenga vivuli vyake, na skrini inaweza kubaki nyeusi kwa dakika chache.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 3 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-3 = Kagua toleo la Proton kwenye Properties za mchezo, chini ya Compatibility, na ujaribu jingine.

# Help topic "Playing games": step 4 of the numbered steps at block 4.
settings-help-topics-games-step4-4 = Ingia kwenye kizinduzi cha mchezo chenyewe, kama Ubisoft Connect. Dirisha lake linaweza kujificha nyuma ya mchezo wa skrini nzima. Bonyeza Alt-Tab ulipate.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 5.
settings-help-topics-games-p5 = Kinga dhidi ya udanganyifu inayoendeshwa ndani ya kernel, kama Vanguard, haiwezi kuendeshwa kwenye Linux kabisa. Easy Anti-Cheat na BattlEye hufanya kazi tu kwa mchezo ambao mchapishaji wake ameruhusu Linux.

# Help topic "Playing games": paragraph 6.
settings-help-topics-games-p6 = Kibodi na kipanya vinafanya kazi. Vidhibiti vya PlayStation, Switch na Xbox vingi, na Steam Input, huenda visifanye kazi kwenye michezo bado. Trindle ina huduma ndogo ya vidhibiti vya michezo, lakini sehemu zinazoitumia hazijakamilika.

# Help topic "Playing games": tip 7.
settings-help-topics-games-tip7 = HDR na kiwango kinachobadilika cha kuonyesha upya bado havitumiki.



# Title of the Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect".
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-title = Kifaa cha Bluetooth hakiunganishi

# Words people might search for the Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-keywords = bluetooth haiunganishi unganisha sahau oanisha tena vipokea sauti havifanyi kazi kimeoanishwa awali uoanishaji wa zamani connect connecting forget pair again headphones not working paired before old pairing key authentication

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p1 = Washa kifaa na kiweke karibu. Kama kiliwahi kuoanishwa na hakiunganishi, au kinaunganisha kisha kinakatika mara moja, uoanishaji uliohifadhiwa kwenye kompyuta hii huenda haulingani tena na ule ulio ndani ya kifaa. Hili hutokea baada ya kifaa kuwekwa upya au kuoanishwa na kompyuta nyingine.

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p2 = Bonyeza Sahau na uoanishe tena kando ya kifaa, au pipa la taka ili kukisahau tu. Kisha weka kifaa katika hali ya kuoanisha, kama maelekezo yake yanavyosema, na bonyeza Oanisha kando yake kinapoonekana chini ya vifaa vilivyo karibu.

# Help topic "A Bluetooth device will not connect": paragraph 3.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-connect-p3 = Kama bado kinashindwa, sentensi iliyo chini ya kifaa inaeleza sababu: Bluetooth imezimwa, kifaa hakijibu, nambari imekataliwa, au wasifu wa sauti haujawa tayari. Kifaa kisichosema chochote kwa nusu dakika hakijibu. Kizime, kiwashe tena, halafu jaribu tena.

# Title of the Help topic "Headphones sound basic".
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-title = Vipokea sauti vinasikika vya kawaida tu

# Words people might search for the Help topic "Headphones sound basic" by, in lower case, separated by spaces.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-keywords = bluetooth ubora wa sauti kodeki vipokea sauti vya kawaida sauti mbaya imezimwa imewashwa bluetooth sound quality codec headphones basic sbc switched off on

# Help topic "Headphones sound basic": paragraph 1.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-p1 = Bluetooth inapozimwa na kuwashwa tena, mfumo wa sauti unaweza kukosa njia bora za kutuma sauti kwa vipokea sauti, na kurudi kwenye njia ya kawaida. Trindle huanzisha upya sehemu ya Bluetooth ya mfumo wako wa sauti kwa ajili yako muda mfupi baada ya Bluetooth kurudi.

# Help topic "Headphones sound basic": paragraph 2.
settings-help-topics-bluetooth-codec-p2 = Kama kuanzisha upya hakukufanikiwa, toka kisha ingia tena na ubora bora utarudi.

